1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,500
For The Gambia, our homeland

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:11,400
We strive and work and pray,

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:17,300
That all may live in unity,

4
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:23,000
Freedom and peace each day.

5
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:28,800
Let justice guide our actions

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Towards the common good,

7
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:41,100
And join our diverse peoples

8
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:47,900
To prove man's brotherhood.

9
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:53,300
We pledge our firm allegiance,

10
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:59,600
Our promise we renew;

11
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:05,400
Keep us, great God of nations,

12
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:14,000
To The Gambia ever true.